  "claim_short": "The semiprojective Banach lattice C[0,1] contains a lattice-isometric copy Y of c_0 that is the range of a bounded linear projection of exact norm 2. The source paper's Corollary 5.8 proves that c_0 is not semiprojective. Consequently, semiprojectivity does not pass to complemented sublattices in the standard bounded-linear-complementation sense.",
